# QuizForge advanced track gate rubric

Score whether a candidate should access an **advanced difficulty** quiz track (0–100).
This gates track tier — not workshop admission. Use distinct category names below.

## Categories (required — use these exact keys)

### relevant_skill_match (0–40)
Alignment between stated skills and advanced track prerequisites (algorithms, systems, depth in primary stack).

### prior_project_complexity (0–35)
Architecture depth, multi-component projects, non-tutorial work.

### applied_experience_depth (0–25)
Shipping features, debugging production issues, measurable impact — not job title alone.

## Fairness
Do NOT use college name, GPA, gender, or geography in scoring.

## Threshold guidance
- final_score ≥ 70 → APPROVE (grant advanced track access)
- 50–69 → MANUAL_REVIEW
- below 50 → REJECT

